                       "paragraphNumber":  0,
                       "paragraphIndex":  0,
                       "text":  "Psalm 93 God Is a Mighty King - The LORD is king, robed with majesty; the LORD is robed, girded with might. The world will surely stand in place, never to be moved.",
                       "isPoetry":  false
                   },
                   {
                       "label":  "2",
                       "number":  2,
                       "subVerseIndex":  0,
                       "paragraphNumber":  0,
                       "paragraphIndex":  0,
                       "text":  "Your throne stands firm from of old; you are from everlasting.",
                       "isPoetry":  false
                   },
                   {
                       "label":  "3",
                       "number":  3,
                       "subVerseIndex":  0,
                       "paragraphNumber":  0,
                       "paragraphIndex":  0,
                       "text":  "The flood has raised up, LORD; the flood has raised up its roar; the flood has raised its pounding waves.",
                       "isPoetry":  false
                   },
                   {
                       "label":  "4",
                       "number":  4,
                       "subVerseIndex":  0,
                       "paragraphNumber":  0,
                       "paragraphIndex":  0,
                       "text":  "More powerful than the roar of many waters, more powerful than the breakers of the sea, powerful in the heavens is the LORD.",
                       "isPoetry":  false
                   },
                   {
                       "label":  "5",
                       "number":  5,
                       "subVerseIndex":  0,
                       "paragraphNumber":  0,
                       "paragraphIndex":  0,
                       "text":  "Your decrees are firmly established; holiness befits your house, LORD, for all the length of days.",
                       "isPoetry":  false
                   }
               ],
    "marks":  [

              ]
}